WEBVTT

00:00:06.632 --> 00:00:09.112
(CHATTERS, GRUNTS)

00:00:11.152 --> 00:00:12.832
(HUMMING)

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:14.832
Sheriff, I can see
your dwelling from here.

00:00:14.872 --> 00:00:16.992
-You're almost home.
-Nirvana is coming.

00:00:17.072 --> 00:00:19.672
-The mystic portal awaits.
-Will you be quiet?

00:00:19.712 --> 00:00:21.232
You guys don't get it, do you?

00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:24.552
Once we go into Sid's house,
we won't be coming out.

00:00:24.632 --> 00:00:27.192
-(BARKING)
-Whoa, Scud! Hey, boy!

00:00:27.232 --> 00:00:29.272
-Sit! Good boy.
-(GROWLING)

00:00:29.352 --> 00:00:32.192
-Hey, I got something for you, boy.
-Freeze!

00:00:32.552 --> 00:00:36.792
-(GROWLS, PANTING)
-Ready, set, now!

00:00:36.872 --> 00:00:38.152
-(SNARLING)
-(ALIEN SQUEAKING)

00:00:38.192 --> 00:00:40.712
Hannah!
Hey, Hannah!

00:00:40.952 --> 00:00:42.912
-What?
-Did I get my package in the mail?

00:00:42.992 --> 00:00:45.352
-I don't know.
-What do you mean you don't know?

00:00:45.472 --> 00:00:47.672
-I don't know!
-(SIGHS)

00:00:48.112 --> 00:00:51.072
-Oh, no, Hannah! Look, Janie!
-What? Hey!

00:00:51.152 --> 00:00:52.952
-She's sick!
-No, she's not!

00:00:53.032 --> 00:00:55.552
I'll have to perform
one of my operations.

00:00:55.592 --> 00:00:58.192
-HANNAH: No!
-No, not Sid's room. Not there.

00:00:58.232 --> 00:01:00.232
Hey, give her back!

00:01:00.232 --> 00:01:02.072
Sid! Sid!

00:01:02.992 --> 00:01:06.312
Oh, no, we have
a sick patient here, nurse.

00:01:06.392 --> 00:01:08.392
-(BANGING ON DOOR)
-Prepare the OR, stat!

00:01:08.432 --> 00:01:12.712
(SINISTER CHUCKLE)
Patient is... prepped.

00:01:13.512 --> 00:01:18.272
No one's ever attempted a double
bypass brain transplant before.

00:01:19.352 --> 00:01:22.152
Now for the tricky part.
Pliers!

00:01:22.232 --> 00:01:25.072
I don't believe that man's
ever been to medical school.

00:01:25.592 --> 00:01:29.632
(CHUCKLES, IMITATES NURSE)
Doctor, you've done it!

00:01:30.872 --> 00:01:32.272
Hannah!

00:01:32.952 --> 00:01:35.512
-Janie's all better now.
-(SCREAMING)

00:01:35.592 --> 00:01:39.072
HANNAH: Mom! Mom!
SID: She's lying!

00:01:39.152 --> 00:01:41.792
Whatever she says,
it's not true!

00:01:41.912 --> 00:01:43.912
(DEPARTING FOOTFALLS)

00:01:44.952 --> 00:01:47.432
(GASPING, SHUDDERING)

00:01:49.152 --> 00:01:51.272
(SHUDDERING)

00:01:54.272 --> 00:01:56.992
We are gonna die.
I'm outta here!

00:02:01.072 --> 00:02:03.272
Locked.

00:02:03.352 --> 00:02:05.592
There's gotta be another way
outta here.

00:02:05.832 --> 00:02:07.952
(RUSTLING)

00:02:16.672 --> 00:02:20.032
Uh, Buzz?
W-Was that you?

00:02:21.632 --> 00:02:24.352
-(TEETH CHATTERING, GASPS)
-(CREAKING)

00:02:24.592 --> 00:02:26.552
(RUSTLING)

00:02:26.632 --> 00:02:28.632
(CREAKING)

00:02:29.632 --> 00:02:32.112
Hey, hi there, little fella.

00:02:32.152 --> 00:02:35.552
Come out here.
Do you know a way outta here?

00:02:39.272 --> 00:02:42.392
(GASPS, TEETH CHATTERING)

00:02:45.672 --> 00:02:47.192
(GASPS)

00:02:50.152 --> 00:02:51.152
(GASPS)

00:02:51.192 --> 00:02:52.352
(BOX PLAYS
POP GOES THE WEASEL)

00:03:01.352 --> 00:03:04.232
(YELLS, MUTTERING, GIBBERING)

00:03:04.352 --> 00:03:07.392
B-B-B-B-Bu... Buzz!

00:03:18.792 --> 00:03:20.872
-They're cannibals.
-(GASPS)

00:03:23.952 --> 00:03:25.152
-(BUZZES)
-Mayday, mayday.

00:03:25.192 --> 00:03:27.512
Come in, Star Command.
Send reinforcements.

00:03:27.552 --> 00:03:29.912
-(TEETH CHATTERING)
-Star Command, do you copy?

00:03:30.312 --> 00:03:32.792
-(BUZZING)
-I've set my laser from stun to kill.

00:03:32.872 --> 00:03:37.032
Aw, great. Great. Yeah, and if anyone
attacks us, we can blink 'em to death.

00:03:39.032 --> 00:03:40.392
(RUSTLING)

00:03:40.512 --> 00:03:42.552
REX: Hey, you guys,
I think I found him!

00:03:42.632 --> 00:03:45.352
-Buzz, is that you?
-(CAT YOWLS)

00:03:45.392 --> 00:03:47.472
Whiskers, will you
get outta here!

00:03:47.552 --> 00:03:49.632
You're interfering
with the search and rescue!

00:03:49.712 --> 00:03:53.672
-(CAR APPROACHING)
-(GASPS) Look, they're home.

00:03:58.792 --> 00:04:00.432
Mom, have you seen Woody?

00:04:00.512 --> 00:04:03.432
-Where was the last place you left him?
-Right here in the van.

00:04:03.512 --> 00:04:06.232
Oh, I'm sure he's there.
You're just not looking hard enough.

00:04:06.352 --> 00:04:08.792
He's not here, Mom.
Woody's gone.

00:04:08.992 --> 00:04:11.232
(GASPS) Woody's gone?

00:04:11.312 --> 00:04:13.232
Yeah, boy, the weasel ran away.

00:04:13.312 --> 00:04:15.432
Huh? Huh?
I told you he was guilty.

00:04:15.512 --> 00:04:19.752
Who would've thought he was
capable of such atrocities?

00:04:21.352 --> 00:04:24.072
Oh, Slink,
I hope he's okay.

00:04:27.032 --> 00:04:32.152
SID: Oh, a survivor.
Where's the rebel base? Talk!

00:04:34.512 --> 00:04:37.112
I can see your will is strong.

00:04:38.432 --> 00:04:41.832
Well, we have ways
of making you talk.

00:04:48.072 --> 00:04:50.592
(SIZZLING)

00:04:51.672 --> 00:04:56.272
Where are your rebel friends now?
(SINISTER CHUCKLE)

00:04:56.352 --> 00:04:57.912
SID'S MOM:
Sid, your Pop Tarts are ready!

00:04:57.952 --> 00:04:59.552
All right!

00:05:00.792 --> 00:05:03.512
-(SIZZLING CONTINUES)
-(SCREAMING)

00:05:07.792 --> 00:05:11.312
(GRUNTING)

00:05:11.352 --> 00:05:13.872
Are you all right?
I'm proud of you, Sheriff.

00:05:13.952 --> 00:05:16.632
A lesser man would've talked
under such torture.

00:05:17.392 --> 00:05:19.672
I sure hope this isn't permanent.

00:05:19.752 --> 00:05:23.032
Still no word from Star Command.
We're not that far from the space port.

00:05:23.112 --> 00:05:25.552
The door. It's open!
We're free!

00:05:25.632 --> 00:05:26.792
Woody, we don't know what's out there!

00:05:26.872 --> 00:05:29.152
I'll tell you wha... (SCREAMS)

00:05:30.392 --> 00:05:32.632
They're gonna eat us, Buzz!
Do something quick!

00:05:32.712 --> 00:05:35.112
-Shield your eyes.
-(BUZZING)

00:05:36.472 --> 00:05:39.312
It's not working. I recharged it
before I left. It should be good for...

00:05:39.352 --> 00:05:43.032
You idiot! You're a toy!
Use your karate chop action!

00:05:43.512 --> 00:05:45.832
-Get away! Hoo-cha!
-Hey! Hey! How're you doin' that?

00:05:45.872 --> 00:05:48.712
-Stop that.
-Back! Back, you savages! Back!

00:05:48.792 --> 00:05:52.552
-Woody, stop it!
-Sorry, guys, but dinner's canceled!

00:05:52.832 --> 00:05:55.472
There's no place like home!
There's no place like home!

00:05:56.312 --> 00:05:59.832
-There's no place like home. (GASPS)
-(SNARLING)

00:06:01.992 --> 00:06:04.032
(SNORING)

00:06:10.032 --> 00:06:12.192
(MUFFLED YELL, GASPING)

00:06:12.232 --> 00:06:14.552
Another stunt like that, cowboy,
you're gonna get us killed.

00:06:14.632 --> 00:06:17.472
-Don't tell me what to do.
-Shh!

00:06:18.072 --> 00:06:21.032
(SNORING CONTINUES)

